#exception-box(title: "THE SEVEN FATAL CUET TRAPS")[
  1. *Trap 1 (Panchsheel Signing Date):* Panchsheel was signed on *29 April 1954*, NOT in 1950 or 1962.
  2. *Trap 2 (Dalai Lama's Asylum Year):* The Dalai Lama was granted political asylum in *March 1959*, NOT in 1950 (when China first entered Tibet).
  3. *Trap 3 (Tashkent Mediator):* The Tashkent Agreement (1966) was mediated by Soviet Premier *Alexei Kosygin*, NOT Nikita Khrushchev or the United Nations.
  4. *Trap 4 (Indus Waters Treaty Mediator):* The Indus Waters Treaty was brokered by the *World Bank* in 1960, NOT the UN or the USSR.
  5. *Trap 5 (Shimla Agreement Signatories):* Signed by *Indira Gandhi and Zulfikar Ali Bhutto* in *July 1972*, NOT Ayub Khan or Yahya Khan.
  6. *Trap 6 (Indo-Soviet Treaty Year):* Signed on *9 August 1971* (before the war), NOT after the 1971 war ended.
  7. *Trap 7 (Pokhran-I vs Pokhran-II):* Pokhran-I took place in *May 1974* (Indira Gandhi); Pokhran-II took place in *May 1998* (Atal Bihari Vajpayee).
]

